### Context Engineering Structure
```
aws-q-apprunner-platform/
├── .context/                           # Context Engineering
│   ├── prompts/
│   │   └── product-requirements.prp    # This PRP file
│   ├── rules/
│   │   └── aws-native.rules           # AWS development rules
│   └── templates/
│       └── deployment-prompt.template  # Deployment context template
├── .aws-q/                            # AWS Q Developer Configuration
│   ├── agents/
│   │   └── infrastructure-agent.yaml  # Agentic behavior definitions
│   ├── workflows/
│   │   └── deployment-workflow.yaml   # Intelligent deployment flows
│   └── knowledge/
│       └── app-runner-patterns.md     # Best practices knowledge base
├── infrastructure/                     # Infrastructure as Code
│   ├── base/
│   │   ├── base-infrastructure-stack.yaml
│   │   └── parameters.json
│   └── applications/
│       ├── application-service-stack.yaml
│       └── parameters-template.json
├── examples/                          # Reference Implementations
│   └── spring-boot/
│       ├── main/
│       ├── Dockerfile
│       └── pom.xml
└── assets/
    └── architecture.png
```

This structure enables AWS Q Developer to understand project context, apply intelligent automation, and provide context-aware assistance throughout the development lifecycle.